2.2.5 The Contractor shall procure that the named sub-contractor shall comply with the following key dates and milestones relevant to the M&E Works:

(a) commencement of M&E installation works on site: no later than 1 August 2024;

(b) completion of first fix M&E works: no later than 31 March 2025;

(c) completion of second fix M&E works: no later than 30 September 2025;

(d) completion of testing, commissioning and balancing: no later than 30 November 2025; and

(e) completion of all M&E works and handover of operation and maintenance manuals: no later than 31 January 2026.

2.2.6 The Contractor shall procure that the named sub-contractor provides to the Contractor, for submission to the Employer's Agent, a monthly progress report in a form reasonably approved by the Employer's Agent, including:

(a) progress against the M&E programme and key dates;

(b) details of any actual or potential delay, with proposed mitigation measures;

(c) labour and plant resources on site;

(d) any health, safety or environmental incidents;
